	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AoWMabRRsBQTxCJgU",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 30, DX 9, IQ 10, HT 14, HP 36, WILL 11, PER 10, FP 14, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 4, DODGE 8, DR 7. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "Ai2AkopWCnCpfarII",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 52 (offense 14, protection 38), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AOeJru8seSItxTwX5",
			"text": "Corrosive Slime (1d-2 corrosion), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. The delver may exude a highly corrosive slime. Anything that touches the delver takes damage that depends on the material composition. Anything organic takes 1d-2 corrosion damage, anything made of metal takes 2d corrosion damage, and anything made of stone takes 4d corrosion damage."
		},
